    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lumiose City is just bursting with Pokémon!\nDon’t you think it’s wonderful?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "After hearing how folks here live in harmony with\nPokémon, I just had to visit and see for myself.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAnd I’m so, so glad I did!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 133
    },
    {
      "displayText": "When it comes to getting along with Pokémon,\nthough, I could give the city a run for its money!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See my two cuties here? They were a Cleffa and a\nBuneary when I first became their Trainer.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "We’ve been traveling together ever since—and\nthanks to that, they were able to evolve into<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nClefairy and Lopunny!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 120
    },
    {
      "displayText": "See, these Pokémon don’t evolve unless they’re\nreally friendly with their Trainer!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah! But here’s an idea: Why don’t we have a\nbattle?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat way, I can show you just how close I am with\nmy dear Pokémon!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let me know when you’re in the mood for a\nbattle, all right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F00770020007700680065006E00200079006F007520190072006500200069006E00200074006800650020006D006F006F006400200066006F007200200061000A0062006100740074006C0065002C00200061006C006C002000720069006700680074003F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "How about a battle, then? Clefairy and Lopunny\nare keen to show you just how close we all are!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Let’s do it!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500742019007300200064006F00200069007400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No, thanks",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F002C0020007400680061006E006B00730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, that’s no fun!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200074006800610074201900730020006E006F002000660075006E002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Great! Let’s keep it nice and friendly, shall we?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0047007200650061007400210020004C00650074201900730020006B0065006500700020006900740020006E00690063006500200061006E006400200066007200690065006E0064006C0079002C0020007300680061006C006C002000770065003F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dear me. It looks like we lost!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00440065006100720020006D0065002E0020004900740020006C006F006F006B00730020006C0069006B00650020007700650020006C006F00730074002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You and your Pokémon were really working as a\nperfect team!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F007500200061006E006400200079006F0075007200200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000770065007200650020007200650061006C006C007900200077006F0072006B0069006E006700200061007300200061000A00700065007200660065006300740020007400650061006D002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You might even be just as friendly with your\nPokémon as I am with mine!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, but speaking of my Pokémon...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C002000620075007400200073007000650061006B0069006E00670020006F00660020006D007900200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002E002E002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "my two cuties must be feeling pretty down after\nlosing to you.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "006D0079002000740077006F00200063007500740069006500730020006D0075007300740020006200650020006600650065006C0069006E0067002000700072006500740074007900200064006F0077006E002000610066007400650072000A006C006F00730069006E006700200074006F00200079006F0075002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But some quality relaxation time here at the café\nshould cheer them up in no time!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You know that’s a great thing to do, right?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00750020006B006E006F00770020007400680061007420190073002000610020006700720065006100740020007400680069006E006700200074006F00200064006F002C002000720069006700680074003F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Spending time at cafés with your Pokémon helps\nyou deepen your bonds and become close friends!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Make sure to try it out with your own darling\nPokémon, won’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0061006B00650020007300750072006500200074006F00200074007200790020006900740020006F007500740020007700690074006800200079006F007500720020006F0077006E0020006400610072006C0069006E0067000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C00200077006F006E2019007400200079006F0075003F00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
